"P3023667903" "Commence Education: Rikti Factions. Rikti invasion: Stalled. Rikti on Earth: Stranded. Rikti on Earth: Divided. Two Factions: Traditionalist, Restructurist. Restructurists seek: New social model. Restructurists: Mostly military. Restructurists core belief: Merit, Success, Power. Restructurists: Military, Majority. My Faction: Restructurist. <br><br>Traditionalists: Culturally bound. Traditionalists: Seek stable society on Human Earth. Traditionalists: Enemies. Traditionalists: Outnumbered: Desperate. Desperation: May negotiate: Heroes. My goal: Sabotage negotiation stance. First matter: Acquire traditionalist weapons. Fortunate event: Traditionalist weapons: Researched by Council.<A HREF={ACCEPT}> {VillainName} objective: Steal weapons from Council.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2859230765" "Steal Rikti weapons from the Council"
